ig they are; this season's sandbars are not known."],["Wind","No report from North Island in the last hour and a half."],["Watching","Former hurricane [Trudy](https://www.nhc.noaa.gov/archive/2026/TRUDY_graphics.php): every fix NHC has logged or forecast is behind land from Point Loma South, so nothing it has sent reaches the breaks."]]}}